        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana HRBM325, 3-1/4 Inch Projection Heavy Duty Modern Handrail Bracket</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Handrail Bracket is used to support stair hand rails. It has a  a 3-7/16 inch projection off the wall. The Heavy Duty Modern Handrail Bracket is available in 7 finishes. This hand rail bracket comes packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-HRBM325-specifications.gif?v=1704354570\" width=\"582\" height=\"249\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana HRBM325 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-HRBM325-installed.jpg?v=1704354570\" width=\"250\" height=\"198\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Deltana HRBM325 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Stair Handrail Bracket:\r\n</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Height: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-HRBM325-specifications.pdf?v=1704262375\"><b>Deltana HRBM325 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
